    <h2 data-v9-reveal style="--d:60ms">Two questions changed the search.</h2>
    <ol class="cs-qs">
      <li data-v9-reveal><span>01</span>What would this person own in month one?</li>
      <li data-v9-reveal style="--d:80ms"><span>02</span>What would have to go wrong for it to be a bad hire?</li>
    </ol>
    <p data-v9-reveal class="lead cs-after">
      From the answers came six skills, weighted, written down and agreed. Every interviewer scored the same six from
      then on, and so did we, on the eleven people the search had already turned away.
    </p>
